WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.698
Signing in is now guarded: against guessing, for suspended accounts, and on the way

00:00:06.698 --> 00:00:08.639
back to where you were going.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.131
Five wrong passwords for one email in fifteen minutes, and sign-in pauses. The next

00:00:15.131 --> 00:00:18.213
try is refused, even with the right password.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.917
The pause lifts as the oldest failure leaves the fifteen minutes. An unknown email

00:00:24.917 --> 00:00:28.155
pauses too, so it never tells who has an account.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.003
A suspended member who gives the right password is told so, and to contact the team.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.894
Open a member page while signed out, sign in, and you are taken straight back to it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.826
A link that tries to send you to another site after sign-in opens Home instead.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.749
And one network can create five profiles an hour. The sixth is refused, and

00:01:00.749 --> 00:01:02.505
everything typed stays.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.131
Next, slice nine point two: two-step verification for staff.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.977
That's slice three point two. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:22.977 --> 00:01:24.225
body and spirit.
